<title>AUSTRALIA: Westpac issuing A$604 mln securitised bonds.</title>
<headline>Westpac issuing A$604 mln securitised bonds.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Westpac Baning Corporation said on Monday it is launching A$604 million of mortgaged backed bonds, its first public securitised offering.</p>
</text>
